meta {
  name: Get Chapter Pages
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/chapter/:chap_id/pages
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  chap_id: one-piece.49::1
}

assert {
  res.status: in [200, 404]
}

docs {
  # Get Chapter Pages
  Returns a sorted list of relative image URL paths for all pages archived inside a downloaded chapter's CBZ container.

  ### Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Format | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|--------|-------------|
  | `chap_id` | string | **Yes** | `{manga_id}::{chapter_number}` | Compound chapter identifier (e.g. `one-piece.49::1` or `bleach.123::10.5`). |

  ### Responses
  - **`200 OK`**: JSON array of relative page image paths.
    ```json
    [
      "/api/image/one-piece.49::1/001.jpg",
      "/api/image/one-piece.49::1/002.jpg",
      "/api/image/one-piece.49::1/003.jpg"
    ]
    ```
  - **`404 Not Found`**: Returned if the chapter CBZ archive has not been downloaded yet.
}
